    "description": "The Investment Portfolio Holdings API enables users to access detailed information about the holdings within investment portfolios. This endpoint facilitates the retrieval of current holdings, allowing financial analysts, investment managers, and clients to effectively monitor and assess their portfolios. Users can expect to retrieve data such as asset types, quantities, and valuations, which are essential for portfolio analysis and reporting. This API is ideal for financial services applications that require real-time insights into investment holdings and their performance.",
